      "claim": "SUB(x^3-3x+1, 0) == 1 ;; SUB(x^3-3x+1, 1) == -1 ;; SUB(x^3-3x+1, 0.5) == -0.375 ;; SUB(x^3-3x+1, 0.25) == 0.265625 ;; SUB(x^3-3x+1, 0.375) < 0"
